{"sha": "7c85900b09a00721a2e76c331ad9e444154e02b3341001e930f04e18fd4da75e", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:reaction-free-energy} 章 --- 熵与反应自由能}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:1}", "(a) 三摩尔气体变为液体：$\\Delta_r S^\\circ < 0$。(b) 生成了一种", "气体：$> 0$。(c) 一个气体分子变为两个：$> 0$。(d) 溶液中的离子", "形成晶体：$< 0$。(e) 熔化：$> 0$。(f) $\\Delta\\nu_{\\text{气体}} = 0$：", "数值较小，此处为正（由表中数据得 \\qty{+20}{J/(K.mol)}，\\ce{HCl}", "其对称性低于 \\ce{H2} 与 \\ce{Cl2}）。", "% ledger: s0:HCl_g, s0:H2_g, s0:Cl2_g", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:2}", "$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = 2(192.77) - 191.61 - 3(130.68) = \\qty{-198.1}{J/(K.mol)}$；", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = -91.9 - 298.15 \\times (-0.1981) = \\qty{-32.8}{kJ/mol}$：", "该反应在 \\qty{298}{K} 下为放能的，尽管熵项（\\qty{+59.1}{kJ/mol}）", "起阻碍作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:3}", "$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = 69.95 - 130.68 - \\tfrac12(205.15) = \\qty{-163.3}{J/(K.mol)}$；", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = -285.83 + 298.15 \\times 0.1633 = \\qty{-237.14}{kJ/mol}$。", "该反应是液态水的生成反应（由处于参考态的单质生成", "一摩尔液态水），因此其标准反应吉布斯自由能按定义", "等于 $\\Delta_f G^\\circ(\\ce{H2O}, \\text{l})$；", "查表所得数值与之相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:4}", "在 \\qty{298}{K} 时约为 \\qty{42}{J/(K.mol)}，在", "\\qty{1000}{K}（液态）时约为 \\qty{87}{J/(K.mol)}。跃变：在 \\qty{692.7}{K} 时为 \\qty{10.6}{J/(K.mol)}，", "在 \\qty{1180.2}{K} 时为 \\qty{97.7}{J/(K.mol)}。由此 $\\Delta_{\\text{熔化}}H = 10.6 \\times", "692.7 = \\qty{7.3}{kJ/mol}$，$\\Delta_{\\text{汽化}}H = 97.7 \\times 1180.2 =", "\\qty{115}{kJ/mol}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:5}", "$\\Delta_r H^\\circ = \\qty{44.00}{kJ/mol}$，$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = 188.84 - 69.95 =", "\\qty{118.9}{J/(K.mol)}$，$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = 44.00 - 298.15 \\times 0.1189 =", "\\qty{+8.55}{kJ/mol}$。在 \\qty{298}{K} 下该变化不可逆（液态", "水与 \\qty{1}{bar} 下的蒸气不处于平衡），因此 $\\Delta S \\ne", "Q/T$：$\\Delta_r H^\\circ/T = \\qty{147.6}{J/(K.mol)}$。正的", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ$ 为正表示在 \\qty{298}{K} 下水不会蒸发为", "\\qty{1}{bar} 的纯蒸气气氛，蒸气反而凝结。两相", "在 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ = 0$ 时处于平衡：$T = 44\\,004/118.9 =", "\\qty{370}{K}$，与正常沸点相差不到 \\qty{3}{K}，", "（\\qty{373}{K}）相差不到 \\qty{3}{K}：埃林厄姆近似在 \\qty{75}{K} 的范围内是可靠的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:6}", "$T_i = 57\\,100/175.7 = \\qty{325}{K}$。低于此温度时 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ > 0$，且", "无色的 \\ce{N2O4} 更为有利；冷却试管使气体向", "\\ce{N2O4} 方向移动，\\ce{NO2} 的棕色变淡（与组成的定量联系", "见\\cref{ch:b2:equilibrium-shifts}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:7}", "$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = -\\dd\\Delta_r G^\\circ/\\dd T = -(-4.0 + 12.0)/100 =", "\\qty{-0.080}{kJ/(K.mol)} = \\qty{-80}{J/(K.mol)}$，且 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ =", "\\Delta_r G^\\circ + T\\Delta_r S^\\circ = -12.0 + 300 \\times (-0.080) =", "\\qty{-36.0}{kJ/mol}$。校验：$\\Delta_r G^\\circ/T$ 由 $-0.0400$ 变为", "$\\qty{-0.0100}{kJ/(K.mol)}$，斜率为 $3.00 \\times 10^{-4}$ 每开尔文，等于", "$-\\Delta_r H^\\circ/T^2 = 36.0/346^2 = 3.00 \\times 10^{-4}$，此为", "几何平均温度 $\\sqrt{300 \\times 400} = \\qty{346}{K}$ 处的值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:8}", "$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = 186.25 - 5.74 - 2(130.68) = \\qty{-80.8}{J/(K.mol)}$，", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = -74.87 + 298.15 \\times 0.0808 = \\qty{-50.8}{kJ/mol}$，", "即表列甲烷的 $\\Delta_f G^\\circ$。两项符号相同，", "甲烷在高于 $T_i = 74\\,870/80.8 \\approx", "\\qty{926}{K}$ 时变得不稳定（埃林厄姆近似）：热甲烷裂解为碳和", "氢，这是同时获得两者的途径。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:9}", "取代：\\ce{CH3CHBrCH3 + OH- -> CH3CH(OH)CH3 + Br-}；消除：", "\\ce{CH3CHBrCH3 + OH- -> CH2=CHCH3 + H2O + Br-}。两者的标准反应吉布斯自由能之差", "为 $\\Delta(\\Delta_r G^\\circ) = 40 - T \\times", "0.090$，在高于 $40\\,000/90 \\approx \\qty{440}{K}$ 时为负。消除反应", "比取代多生成一个分子，其熵更大，熵项", "随 $T$ 成正比增长。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:10}", "$N_A$ 个分子中每一个都有 2 种取向：$W = 2^{N_A}$，故 $S =", "k_B\\ln 2^{N_A} = R\\ln 2 = \\qty{5.76}{J/(K.mol)}$。晶体并非", "完全有序：在低温下，分子被冻结在其", "随机取向之中，无法达到热力学第三定律所假设的", "唯一有序排列。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:11}", "对 $\\dd\\Delta_r S^\\circ/\\dd T = c/T$ 积分：$\\Delta_r S^\\circ(T) = \\Delta_r", "S^\\circ(T_0) + c\\ln(T/T_0)$；由基尔霍夫定律可得 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ(T) = \\Delta_r", "H^\\circ(T_0) + c(T - T_0)$；减去 $T\\Delta_r S^\\circ(T)$。对于石灰石，在", "\\qty{1100}{K} 时，埃林厄姆近似给出 $178.32 - 1100 \\times 0.16064 = \\qty{1.62}{kJ/mol}$；", "修正项 $c[T - T_0 - T\\ln(T/T_0)] = -0.00195 \\times (801.85 - 1436.3) =", "\\qty{+1.24}{kJ/mol}$，故 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ = \\qty{2.86}{kJ/mol}$。误差", "\\qty{1.2}{kJ/mol}，小于 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ$ 的百分之一，但在", "转变温度附近，它决定了符号。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:reaction-free-energy:12}", "(a) $\\Delta_r H^\\circ = -763.2 + 944.0 = \\qty{+180.8}{kJ/mol}$，$\\Delta_r", "S^\\circ = 353.2 + 205.15 - 50.62 - 2(223.08) = \\qty{+61.6}{J/(K.mol)}$；", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ(1000) = 180.8 - 61.6 = \\qty{+119.2}{kJ/mol}$：吸能的，", "不能发生氯化。(b) 对于 \\ce{C + O2 -> CO2}，$\\Delta_r G^\\circ(1000) =", "-393.5 - 2.9 = \\qty{-396.4}{kJ/mol}$。两式相加得 \\ce{TiO2(s) + 2Cl2(g) + C(s)", "-> TiCl4(g) + CO2(g)}，其 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ = \\qty{-277.2}{kJ/mol}$：碳", "消耗了第一个反应生成的氧气，因而耦合反应", "为强放能的。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}